{"text":"Things like inflation, things like de-globalization, and really the splinternet and the challenge of the, certainly US, but also Western stance vis-a-vis China. There are many other areas in this tactical bucket, but I suspect, as I mentioned earlier, many of them will be covered in the subsequent panels this afternoon. But let me walk you through the structural challenges, and these are particularly problematic because not only were they identified by public policy makers and academics and business people, but they've become particularly problematic in our ability to address the issue of economic growth and many of the challenges around the delivery of public goods such as education, healthcare, national security, and of course, climate change. Put another way, our inability to create economic growth in a sustainable way hampers our ability to address and to deliver on many of the aspects of the leveling up agenda and broader public goods that have been addressed earlier.","words":[{"text":"Things","start":0.0,"end":0.72},{"text":"like","start":0.72,"end":1.34},{"text":"inflation","start":1.34,"end":2.22,"punct":","},{"text":"things","start":3.42,"end":3.42},{"text":"like","start":3.42,"end":3.88},{"text":"de-globalization","start":3.88,"end":5.26,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":5.68,"end":5.68},{"text":"really","start":5.68,"end":6.0},{"text":"the","start":6.0,"end":6.24},{"text":"splinternet","start":6.24,"end":7.12},{"text":"and","start":7.12,"end":7.56},{"text":"the","start":7.56,"end":7.72},{"text":"challenge","start":7.72,"end":8.24},{"text":"of","start":8.24,"end":8.92},{"text":"the","start":8.92,"end":9.18,"punct":","},{"text":"certainly","start":9.18,"end":9.52},{"text":"US","start":9.52,"end":10.0,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":10.36,"end":10.38},{"text":"also","start":10.38,"end":10.74},{"text":"Western","start":10.74,"end":11.26},{"text":"stance","start":11.26,"end":11.96},{"text":"vis-a-vis","start":11.96,"end":12.86},{"text":"China","s